.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Defines the abstraction for process management functions and structures\&. 


.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
PID means Process ID, not to be confused with handles\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBDate\fP
.RS 4
2nd December 2025 
.RE
.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
Max Tyson 
.RE
